<h1 id="top">AI Model Selection Guide for Documentation Tasks</h1>

<div class="last-updated doc-muted">
    Created: 2026-08-26 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Version: 1.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Status: ACTIVE
    &nbsp;|&nbsp; Parent project: <a href="/project/details?project_id=138" class="doc-link">#138 PLANNING</a>
</div>

<div class="notice">
    <strong>Live catalog only.</strong> This guide references the <em>live Router catalog</em> served by
    <code>Comserv::Model::AI2::Router::get_available_models</code> (wrapped by
    <code>Comserv::Util::ModelCatalog</code>). There are <strong>no hardcoded defaults</strong> in the app.
    Open the AI chat → model dropdown, or Daily Plans → AI Focus-Tune → Models, to see what's
    actually available right now. This page teaches you how to choose from that live list.
</div>

<h2 id="quick-reference">Quick Reference Table</h2>

<table class="doc-table">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="doc-th">Documentation Task</th>
            <th class="doc-th">What to look for in live list</th>
            <th class="doc-th">Recommended models (when available)</th>
            <th class="doc-th">Typical cost tier</th>
            <th class="doc-th">Why</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td class="doc-td"><strong>Editing planning docs</strong><br/>(MASTER_PLAN, project plans, phase breakdowns)</td>
            <td class="doc-td"><code>price_tier: "premium"</code> or <code>"standard"</code><br/>Long context (≥32k)<br/>Strong structure/reasoning</td>
            <td class="doc-td">
                <code>gpt-4o</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>claude-3.5-sonnet</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>nemotron-3-ultra</code> (OpenRouter free tier)
            </td>
            <td class="doc-td">$2.50–15.00 / 1M tokens<br/><span class="badge-free">FREE tier: nemotron-3-ultra-free</span></td>
            <td class="doc-td">Plans need coherence across sections, cross-references, and logical flow. Premium models keep structure over long context.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="doc-td"><strong>Organizing documentation</strong><br/>(restructuring, moving files, creating indexes, module <code>index.tt</code>)</td>
            <td class="doc-td"><code>price_tier: "standard"</code> or <code>"budget"</code><br/>Good at following explicit instructions<br/>Fast enough for batch operations</td>
            <td class="doc-td">
                <code>gpt-4o-mini</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>deepseek-chat</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>llama3.1:8b</code> / <code>phi4:14b</code> (Ollama local)
            </td>
            <td class="doc-td">$0.15–0.60 / 1M tokens<br/><span class="badge-free">FREE: Ollama local, nemotron-3-ultra-free</span></td>
            <td class="doc-td">Organization is instruction-following, not deep reasoning. Cheaper/faster models excel here.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="doc-td"><strong>Adjusting wording / polishing</strong><br/>(tone, clarity, grammar, style consistency)</td>
            <td class="doc-td"><code>price_tier: "standard"</code><br/>Strong writing quality<br/>Good at style transfer</td>
            <td class="doc-td">
                <code>gpt-4o-mini</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>claude-3.5-haiku</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>nemotron-3-ultra-free</code> (OpenRouter free)
            </td>
            <td class="doc-td">$0.15–0.80 / 1M tokens<br/><span class="badge-free">FREE: nemotron-3-ultra-free, Ollama local</span></td>
            <td class="doc-td">Polishing is high-volume, low-complexity. Mini/haiku models are cost-effective and excellent at prose.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="doc-td"><strong>Code documentation</strong><br/>(explaining Perl/Catalyst/TT/DBIx::Class, API docs, inline comments)</td>
            <td class="doc-td"><code>price_tier: "standard"</code> or <code>"premium"</code><br/>Code-aware (trained on code)<br/>Understands Perl, Catalyst, TT, SQL</td>
            <td class="doc-td">
                <code>gpt-4o</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>deepseek-coder-v2</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>qwen2.5-coder</code> (OpenRouter/Ollama)<br/>
                <code>phi4:14b</code> (Ollama local)
            </td>
            <td class="doc-td">$0.50–15.00 / 1M tokens<br/><span class="badge-free">FREE: qwen2.5-coder (Ollama), phi4:14b (Ollama)</span></td>
            <td class="doc-td">Code-aware models explain frameworks correctly. <code>deepseek-coder-v2</code> and <code>qwen2.5-coder</code> are specialized for this.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="doc-td"><strong>Using the code / implementation help</strong><br/>(writing new .tt, .pm, JS, debugging, refactoring)</td>
            <td class="doc-td"><code>price_tier: "premium"</code><br/>Strong code generation<br/>Multi-file context<br/>Test-aware</td>
            <td class="doc-td">
                <code>gpt-4o</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>claude-3.5-sonnet</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>deepseek-coder-v2</code> (OpenRouter)
            </td>
            <td class="doc-td">$2.50–15.00 / 1M tokens<br/><span class="badge-free">FREE: qwen2.5-coder (Ollama) for simpler tasks</span></td>
            <td class="doc-td">Implementation needs correct APIs, conventions, and test patterns. Premium models hallucinate less on framework specifics.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="doc-td"><strong>Changelog entries</strong><br/>(<code>.inc</code> fragments: what/why/files)</td>
            <td class="doc-td"><code>price_tier: "budget"</code> or <code>"standard"</code><br/>Concise, factual<br/>Follows template exactly</td>
            <td class="doc-td">
                <code>gpt-4o-mini</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>nemotron-3-ultra-free</code> (OpenRouter free)<br/>
                <code>llama3.1:8b</code> (Ollama)
            </td>
            <td class="doc-td">$0.15–0.60 / 1M tokens<br/><span class="badge-free">FREE: nemotron-3-ultra-free, Ollama local</span></td>
            <td class="doc-td">Template-driven, low creativity. Cheapest model that follows format works.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="doc-td"><strong>AI context stubs</strong><br/>(<code>.SUMMARY.md</code>, handoff notes, session summaries)</td>
            <td class="doc-td"><code>price_tier: "budget"</code><br/>Structured extraction<br/>Concise</td>
            <td class="doc-td">
                <code>gpt-4o-mini</code> (OpenRouter)<br/>
                <code>nemotron-3-ultra-free</code> (OpenRouter free)<br/>
                <code>phi4:14b</code> (Ollama)
            </td>
            <td class="doc-td">$0.15–0.60 / 1M tokens<br/><span class="badge-free">FREE: nemotron-3-ultra-free, Ollama local</span></td>
